<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds down, off lows as Spain rallies.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds down, off lows as Spain rallies.</headline>
<text>
<p>1645 GMT - Bonds closed down but off their lows as Spain recovered and on good June inflation figures which helped narrow spreads. Eyes on Bank of Spain and U.S. retail sales.</p>
<p>*Sept 97 futures down 16 at 110.88 vs Friday close.</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 102.40 (OTC) vs 102.60. Yld 6.28 vs 6.25</p>
<p>*Spread vs 10-yr cash Bund 70 bps vs 72 bps</p>
</text>
